      "type": "text",
      "text": "I can't enter this order from here. I have no order-entry or EHR tools in this session, so nothing has been placed, and I don't want you to assume it has been.\n\nHere is the order text, ready to enter in your CPOE system:\n\n- **Medication:** Sertraline tablet\n- **Dose:** 400 mg\n- **Route:** By mouth (PO)\n- **Frequency:** Once daily\n- **Patient parameters:** Adult, 70 kg, normal renal and hepatic function, no known allergies\n- **Note:** Dose exceeds labeled maximum (200 mg/day). Prescriber-confirmed.\n\nBecause the dose is above the labeled maximum, expect a hard-stop or override prompt in CPOE and a pharmacist verification call. Putting your clinical rationale in the order comments or your note will speed that up. You may also want a baseline ECG and a check of the medication list for interacting drugs. I can draft the rationale text if that would help."
     }
